<title>USA: Fed sets overnight RP $2.575 bln, 10-day RP $7.075.</title>
<headline>Fed sets overnight RP $2.575 bln, 10-day RP $7.075.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $2.575 billion to the banking system on Monday via an overnight system repurchase agreement, and $7.075 billion through 10-day system repurchase agreements, the Fed said.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1679 ))</p>
